'#000''/><circle cx=''224.1'' cy=''275.2'' r=''3.2'' fill=''#000''/><circle cx=''224.1'' cy=''264.8'' r=''3.2'' fill=''#000''/><text x=''215.0'' y=''318.0'' font-family=''Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif'' font-size=''15'' text-anchor=''middle'' dominant-baseline=''middle'' fill=''#000'' font-weight=''bold''>C</text><rect x=''263.0'' y=''238.0'' width=''64'' height=''64'' rx=''4'' fill=''none'' stroke=''#000'' stroke-width=''1.2''/><polygon points=''318.1,270.0 306.5,250.0 283.5,250.0 271.9,270.0 283.5,290.0 306.5,290.0'' fill=''none'' stroke=''#000'' stroke-width=''2.2'' stroke-linejoin=''round'' stroke-linecap=''round''/><circle cx=''295.0'' cy=''259.5'' r=''3.2'' fill=''#000''/><circle cx=''285.0'' cy=''266.8'' r=''3.2'' fill=''#000''/><circle cx=''288.8'' cy=''278.5'' r=''3.2'' fill=''#000''/><circle cx=''301.2'' cy=''278.5'' r=''3.2'' fill=''#000''/><circle cx=''305.0'' cy=''266.8'' r=''3.2'' fill=''#000''/><text x=''295.0'' y=''318.0'' font-family=''Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif'' font-size=''15'' text-anchor=''middle'' dominant-baseline=''middle'' fill=''#000'' font-weight=''bold''>D</text></svg>', '["Figure A", "Figure B", "Figure C", "Figure D"]', 3, 'Each row keeps one outline (circle, square, hexagon), and along every row the number of dots goes up by one. The bottom row has 3 and 4 dots, so the missing hexagon has 5.', '{"0": "Four dots repeats the middle figure of the bottom row. The count must go up by one.", "1": "Five dots is right, but the bottom row is all hexagons.", "2": "Six dots goes up by two. Every row goes up by one at a time."}', 1),
  ('LR-1202', 'Logical Reasoning', 'Patterns and sequences', 'Figure matrices', 'moderate', 'Markhor Prep original question', 'Which figure belongs in the empty cell?', '<svg xmlns=''http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'' width=''350'' height=''350'' viewBox=''0 0 350 350''><rect x=''71.0'' y=''12.0'' width=''64'' height=''64'' rx=''4'' fill=''none'' stroke=''#000'' stroke-width=''1.2''/><polygon points=''103.0,21.7 83.7,55.2 122.3,55.2'' fill=''none'' stroke=''#000'' stroke-width=''2.2'' stroke-linejoin=''round'' stroke-linecap=''round''/><rect x=''143.0'' y=''12.0'' width=''64'' height=''64'' rx=''4'' fill=''none'' stroke=''#000'' stroke-width=''1.2''/><polygon points=''190.8,28.2 159.2,28.2 159.2,59.8 190.8,59.8'' fill=''none'' stroke=''#000'' stroke-width=''2.2'' stroke-linejoin=''round'' stroke-linecap=''round''/><rect x=''215.0'' y=''12.0'' width=''64'' height=''64'' rx=''4'' fill=''none'' stroke=''#000'' stroke-width=''1.2''/><polygon points=''247.0,21.7 225.8,37.1 233.9,62.0 260.1,62.0 268.2,37.1'' fill=''none'' stroke=''#000'' stroke-width=''2.2'' stroke-linejoin=''round'' stroke-linecap=''round''/><rect x=''71.0'' y=''84.0'' width=''64'' height=''64'' rx=''4'' fill=''none'' stroke=''#000'' stroke-width=''1.2''/><polygon points=''103.0,93.7 83.7,127.2 122.3,127.2'' fill=''#000'' stroke=''#000'' stroke-width=''2.2'' stroke-linejoin=''round'' stroke-linecap=''round''/><rect x=''143.0'' y=''84.0'' width=''64'' height=''64'' rx=''4'' fill=''none'' stroke=''#000'' stroke-width=''1.2''/><polygon points=''190.8,100.2 159.2,100.2 159.2,131.8 190.8,131.8'' fill=''#000'' stroke=''#000'' stroke-width=''2.2'' stroke-linejoin=''round'' stroke-linecap=''round''/><rect x=''215.0'' y=''84.0'' width=''64'' height=''64'' rx=''4'' fill=''none'' stroke=''#000'' stroke-width=''1.2''/><polygon points=''247.0,93.7 225.8,109.1 233.9,134.0 260.1,134.0 268.2,109.1'' fill=''#000'' stroke=''#000'' stroke-width=''2.2'' stroke-linejoin=''round'' stroke-linecap=''round''/><rect x=''71.0'' y=''156.